+        // whole function returns, via Heap_Recycle) treat it exactly like
+        // any other fully-dead block -- !BlockMeta_IsMarked triggers
+        // Block_recycleUnmarkedBlock, adding it straight to the free list.
+        BlockMeta_Unmark(meta);
